        "text": "Skip to content\nGRILLED TO\nPERFECTION\nTHE FROG\nOUR STORY\nMENU\nEXPERIENCE\nORDER NOW\nANATOMY\nOF FLAVOR\n01\nBRIOCHE BUN\n\nARTISAN GOLD-BRUSHED BUN.\n\n02\nLETTUCE\n\nCRISP HAND-PICKED GREENS.\n\n03\nRED ONION\n\nHAND-SLICED SHARPNESS.\n\n04\nPICKLES\n\nHOUSE-CURED CRUNCH.\n\n05\nCHEESE\n\nAGED MELTED PERFECTION.\n\n06\nPATTY\n\nCHARCOAL-GRILLED BEEF.\n\n07\nSAUCE\n\nSIGNATURE SECRET RECIPE.\n\n08\nBASE\n\nTOASTED BOTTOM BUN.\n\nABOUT US\n\nWE DON’T BELIEVE IN 'FAST FOOD' AS MUCH AS WE BELIEVE IN 'MASTERFULLY CRAFTED MEALS.' OUR JOURNEY BEGAN WITH A SIMPLE PASSION: TO REDEFINE THE BURGER EXPERIENCE. WE BELIEVE THAT EVERY SINGLE LAYER OF THE SANDWICH—FROM THE GOLDEN, FRESHLY BAKED BRIOCHE BUN TO THE PRIME ANGUS BEEF GRILLED OVER NATURAL CHARCOAL FLAMES—IS A CANVAS UPON WHICH WE POUR ALL OF OUR EXPERTISE. WE ARE HERE TO PROVE THAT A BURGER IS AN ART FORM\n\nFROG MENU\nSIGNATURE SELECTION\nDOUBLE BEAST\n\nDouble patties, double cheddar, bold sauce and extra crunch.\n\nCALORIES\n1100 kcal\nPRICE\n$24.00\nORDER NOW\nCRAFTED FOR THE FIRST BITE\nCRAFTED UNDER PRESSURE\nRESERVE A SEAT\n→\nTHE ART OF HEAVY SMOKE\nGET IN TOUCH\n\nEXPERIENCE THE CRAFT\n\n BAGHDAD, AL-MANSOUR STREET\n\n +964 770 000 0000\n\n HELLO@FROGBURGER.COM\n\nINSTAGRAM TIKTOK\nSEND INQUIRY\nTHE FORGE\n\nEST. 2026\n\nTHE ETHOS\nMENU\nRESERVE\nCONTACT\n\nAL-MANSOUR ST, BAGHDAD\n\nHELLO@FROGBURGER.COM\n\nIG TW TT\n\n© 2026 FROG BURGER. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.\n\nDESIGNED BY SITEBYR.COM"
